### Key Discrepancy Resolutions

The most significant finding: **Option 4 (Production Multi-File, 130KB)** is the correct foundation, but is missing 3 views (PilgrimModeView, PilgrimPassportView, RoutePacks) that exist only in Option 3 (Monolithic V2, 114KB). The proximity detection that everyone thinks lives in Option 3 is actually most complete in Option 4 (30 refs vs 9). Full diff in the decisions doc.

